yunohost (12.1.41.35) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: portal boot routes + bare-prefix redirects (browser fixes).
    - Bare /nostrhost/admin and /nostrhost/sso 301 to the trailing-slash form
      so they reach the SPAs instead of the domain root responder.
    - The portal-api now serves /public (portal boot settings) and /me (the
      signed-in user), which the retired moulinette portal.py used to provide;
      the nuxt portal SPA boots from these and previously got a 404.

